        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"a6083c76-fafc-464a-b704-b6d3e33d9bff\",\"review_text\":\"great selection and quality of sound. worth the 10$ a month. the My Library could use a better organisation as after having a bunch of albums and playlists and artists and songs there its gets hard to find your way around. and the search function could also expand.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3ef844b2-8120-4f5b-a3e7-1e0c0ee8b31e\",\"review_text\":\"This gone to another level now you can't even give your songs till you purchase a premium how do you want people to is your app is they can't even queue which is most basic thing in most of the apps which offers songs Do you even want people to use this app recommendation you some other app then this\"},{\"review_id\":\"6b310133-b01f-4cee-be28-86e5ea0e1d7a\",\"review_text\":\"Toooo many ads! It is so irritating. Pathetic app\"},{\"review_id\":\"b598d203-4ce5-4c99-ba70-676b239a6b64\",\"review_text\":\"I know everyone loves this app, and I'd recommend it to those who haven't heard of it yet\"},{\"review_id\":\"c790f859-7343-487f-a3e1-c75b4a4ccb66\",\"review_text\":\"But have not some music lyrics\"},{\"review_id\":\"c218022b-7594-46e1-b8cb-3617fd7fa5ef\",\"review_text\":\"Been happy with the free service and the occasional ads, but now their are ads that play during the podcasts and it is a mess of audio. If this is some ploy to get people to get premium that's a stupid tactic.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4654f83d-80cf-42a5-96c3-0be868570ee5\",\"review_text\":\"The app is just useless and boring now like what do you mean I have to pay to go back, to shuffle WORST APP. GIVE OLD SPOTIFY BACK\"},{\"review_id\":\"0aa1b2c5-7417-4408-9a3d-a9c21a1e149c\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this application and has country sewden\"},{\"review_id\":\"7fcb936b-d5dd-4e44-94b0-9a77a92d970f\",\"review_text\":\"Great.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9332c84a-5acd-4614-aaf7-781fdc73d840\",\"review_text\":\"I was usually very interested in this app. But I HV noticed that adds the popping so much. I had installed this app BCS before it had rare ads.. lyrics also got disappeared. Very disappointed Spotify team... Unistalling the app I had also told my friends to do so\"}]}"
